### Carteira Pessoal API - Exemplos de Requisições
### Abra em qualquer editor REST Client (VS Code REST Client, Insomnia, Postman)

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@token = seu_access_token_aqui
@userId = seu_user_id_aqui
@refreshToken = seu_refresh_token_aqui

---

### ===== AUTENTICAÇÃO =====

### Registrar novo usuário
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "usuario@email.com",
  "password": "SenhaForte123!",
  "name": "João Silva",
  "phoneNumber": "+5585998765432"
}

###

### Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "usuario@email.com",
  "password": "SenhaForte123!"
}

###

### Renovar Token
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

###

### Logout da sessão atual
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Logout de todas as sessões
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout-all
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### ===== CARTÕES =====

### Listar todos os cartões
GET {{baseUrl}}/cards
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Criar novo cartão
POST {{baseUrl}}/cards
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cardNumber": "1234567890123456",
  "cardHolder": "João Silva",
  "expiryDate": "12/25",
  "cvv": "123"
}

###

### Obter detalhes de um cartão
GET {{baseUrl}}/cards/card_123
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Atualizar cartão
PUT {{baseUrl}}/cards/card_123
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cardHolder": "João Silva Silva",
  "expiryDate": "12/26"
}

###

### Deletar cartão
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/cards/card_123
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### ===== TRANSAÇÕES =====

### Listar transações
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Listar transações com filtros
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions?category=Alimentação&skip=0&take=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Criar nova transação
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Almoço no restaurante",
  "amount": 45.50,
  "category": "Alimentação",
  "cardId": "card_123",
  "installments": 1
}

###

### Criar transação com parcelamento
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Eletrônicos",
  "amount": 1200.00,
  "category": "Eletrônicos",
  "cardId": "card_123",
  "installments": 12
}

###

### Obter detalhes de uma transação
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions/transaction_123
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Atualizar transação
PUT {{baseUrl}}/transactions/transaction_123
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Almoço no restaurante XYZ",
  "amount": 50.00,
  "category": "Alimentação"
}

###

### Marcar transação como concluída
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions/transaction_123/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Marcar parcela específica como paga
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions/transaction_123/pay-installment
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "installmentNumber": 1
}

###

### Deletar transação
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/transactions/transaction_123
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### ===== OTP (One-Time Password) =====

### Enviar código OTP via SMS
POST {{baseUrl}}/otp/send
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Verificar código OTP
POST {{baseUrl}}/otp/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "123456"
}

###

### Reenviar código OTP
POST {{baseUrl}}/otp/resend
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### ===== PIN =====

### Criar PIN
POST {{baseUrl}}/pin/create
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pin": "1234"
}

###

### Verificar PIN
POST {{baseUrl}}/pin/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pin": "1234"
}

###

### Alterar PIN
PUT {{baseUrl}}/pin/change
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "oldPin": "1234",
  "newPin": "5678"
}

###

### ===== SMS =====

### Enviar SMS customizado
POST {{baseUrl}}/sms/send
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Seu código de confirmação é 123456"
}

###

### Verificar status do SMS
GET {{baseUrl}}/sms/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### ===== ORÇAMENTOS =====

### Listar orçamentos
GET {{baseUrl}}/budgets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Criar orçamento
POST {{baseUrl}}/budgets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": "Alimentação",
  "amount": 500.00,
  "month": "2026-04"
}

###

### Atualizar orçamento
PUT {{baseUrl}}/budgets/budget_123
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 600.00
}

###

### Deletar orçamento
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/budgets/budget_123
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### ===== RELATÓRIOS =====

### Relatório mensal
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/monthly?month=2026-04
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Gastos por categoria
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/category?month=2026-04
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Tendências de gastos
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/trends?months=6
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### ===== HEALTH CHECK =====

### Verificar saúde da API
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

###

### Verificar acesso a rota protegida
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/protected
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

